step("Verify: K1 matches RFC 4493 §4 reference (fbeed618…)")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
val (k1, _) = aes128_cmac_subkeys(_rfc4493_key())
expect(k1).to_equal(_expected_K1())
```

</details>

