step("Verify: Example 4: Mlen=64 → 51f0bebf 7e3b9d92 fc497417 79363cfe")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
# 4 full blocks; exercises the K1 path with multiple CBC-MAC iterations.
